For rent, a newly renovated, bright, two-room apartment with an area of 44 square meters is located on Pomorska Street, close to the city center. The apartment, with a direct view of Teodor Axentowicz Square, is located in a quiet neighborhood and has excellent transport links to all parts of the city (200 meters from Inwalidów Square). The Main Market Square is just a 15-minute walk away. The apartment is located in a tenement building with an elevator.

 BUILDING AND LOCATION:
 Building: tenement house (with elevator) from 1936
 Street: Pomorska 10
 Stop: Plac Inwalidów (200 m: tram + bus), Radio Kraków (400 m: a+t)
 Nearby: Aksentowicz Park (20 m), Good Lood ice cream parlor (80 m), Carrefour Express store (90 m), Krakowski Park (110 m), St. Stephen's Church (140 m), gym (170 m), "MuFo" Photography Museum (270 m), Biedronka store (750 m), AGH University of Science and Technology (800 m), a large number of cafes and restaurants in the immediate vicinity
 District: Krowodrza

 APARTMENT:
 Floor: 3/4;
 Area: 44 sq m;
 Room layout: Bedroom/study, living room with kitchenette, hall, bathroom, storage room
 Kitchen equipment: oven, induction hob, hood, refrigerator, fully furnished

 FINANCES:
 - PLN 3,100 rent + approx. PLN 680 administrative fees (including electricity);
 - a refundable deposit of PLN 4,000 is required;
 - commission for the real estate agency;

 COMMENTS:
 - apartment available immediately;
 - city heating;
 - hot water from an electric boiler;
 - northern exposure;
 - consent to pets;
 - paid parking zone C;
 - very bright and spacious apartment;
 - elevator;



